# <%= current_page.data.title %>

Every edge connection that leaves Crime Live for PSN, HMCTS or the MoJ WAN depends on this transport.

## What it is

- **`VG-MPD-OLDAZURE-01`** — the single VPN gateway for Crime Live. `RG-MPD-IMZ-01`, VpnGw3AZ, Gen1, route-based, **not active-active**, gateway-level `enableBgp: false`. Public IP `IP-MPD-OLDAZURE-01` = **51.140.106.116**.
- **Two IPsec tunnels to Cloud Gateway Ltd** (third-party WAN provider, AS205098):

| Connection | Local network gateway | Peer IP | Cloud Gateway POP | BGP ASN | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `VC-MPD-IMZ-LEG-CGI` | `LNG-MPD-LEG-CGI` | 185.230.152.73 | London DX POP (AZ01) | 65021 | Connected |
| `VC-MPD-IMZ-LEG-CGI-DR` | `LNG-MPD-LEG-CGI-DR` | 185.230.154.73 | Manchester DX POP (AZ02) | 65022 | Connected |

- The **"LEG-CGI" name is historical** (legacy CGI). Both peer IPs are registered to Cloud Gateway Ltd in the public IP address registry, and the Cloud Gateway portal lists our gateway (51.140.106.116) as site **CRIME-LIVE**.

## Network flow

```
VN-MPD-IMZ-01 (10.200.64.0/20)
  └─ VG-MPD-OLDAZURE-01 (51.140.106.116)
       ══IPsec══► Cloud Gateway London (185.230.152.73)  ┐
       ══IPsec══► Cloud Gateway Manchester (185.230.154.73) ┘─► PSN │ HMCTS SDS │ Interim Hosting │ MoJ WAN
```

## What it's used for

The transport for PSN (CJSE), DARTS, XHIBIT, Libra GoB and other HMCTS / MoJ paths.

