## Risks

- **Single point of failure** — one gateway, not active-active. If it fails, all Crime Live hybrid connectivity fails.
- No diagnostic settings or tunnel-down alerting on the gateway. No resource locks on `RG-MPD-IMZ-01`.
- **The BCDR runbook understates the impact.** It describes LEG-CGI as "Legacy CGI" and says losing it affects only "Libra / Darts legacy". In practice PSN, DARTS, XHIBIT and others depend on it.

## Improvements / future

- Add resource locks on `RG-MPD-IMZ-01` to prevent accidental deletion of the VPN gateway and its connections (**DR gap**).
